  "title": "Maris-Tech Announces Receipt of Nasdaq Conditional Compliance Determination Regarding Minimum Stockholders’ Equity Requirement",
  "summary": "Rehovot, Israel, June 11, 2026 — Maris-Tech Ltd. (Nasdaq: MTEK, MTEKW) (“Maris-Tech” or the “Company”), a global leader in artificial intelligence (“AI”)-based edge video processing technology, today announced that it has received a letter from the Listing Qualifications staff of The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC (“Nasdaq”) notifying the Company that Nasdaq has determined that the […] The post Maris-Tech Announces Receipt of Nasdaq Conditional Compliance Determination Regarding Minimum Stockholders’ Equity Requirement appeared first on MARIS - TECH .",
